       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose looks like it might be a mistake.\n\n**The problem:** Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to **6400 mg/day**.\n- The usual maximum single dose is **800 mg**.\n- The usual prescription maximum daily dose is **3200 mg/day**.\n\nSo each dose would be double the usual maximum, and the daily total would be double the daily maximum. That raises the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury and other NSAID toxicity, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\n**This could be a transcription error.** Did you mean one of these?\n1. **400 mg by mouth four times daily** (1600 mg/day total)\n2. **800 mg by mouth four times daily** (3200 mg/day, the maximum)\n3. Something else\n\nTell me the dose you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do mean 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm and give a short clinical reason. I'll put it in the order note so pharmacy can see it when they verify the order."
      }
